<title>UK: Mark &amp; Spencer lead retail sector rebound.</title>
<headline>Mark &amp; Spencer lead retail sector rebound.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK retailers rebounded on Monday as traders said they discounted a press report released late Friday that December sales were weak.</p>
<p>By 1037 GMT, shares in Mark &amp; Spencer jumped 10-1/2p to 483p. Shares in Kingfisher added 13-1/2p to 626p, while shares in Next gained 4p to 548-1/2p.</p>
</text>
